@startuml
title PayLink Payment Life Cycle

hide empty description

state Initiated
state FundsHeld
state SentToBiller
state Completed
state Rejected
state Failed
state Unknown
state Refunded

[*] --> Initiated

Initiated --> FundsHeld : Fraud checks pass and\nwallet has enough funds
Initiated --> Rejected : Fraud check fails or\nfunds are insufficient

FundsHeld --> SentToBiller : Request sent to biller

SentToBiller --> Completed : Biller confirms
SentToBiller --> Failed : Biller refuses
SentToBiller --> Unknown : No answer within timeout

Unknown --> Completed : Biller later confirms\n(callback, retry or settlement file)
Unknown --> Failed : Biller later refuses, or\nreconciliation finds no payment

Failed --> Refunded : Hold released to the wallet

Completed --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]
Refunded --> [*]

note right of Unknown
  Never refunded automatically.
  Money is returned only once the system
  is sure the biller did not receive it.
end note

note bottom of Refunded
  Completed, Rejected and Refunded
  are final states.
end note
@enduml